pair(S, 'alu', 'Which processor component performs arithmetic calculations and logical comparisons?', 'Your game checks whether the score is greater than 100. Which processor component carries out that comparison?', 'Arithmetic and logic unit (ALU)', ['Control unit', 'Address bus', 'Main memory'], 'The ALU carries out arithmetic and logical operations.');
